   'Arias and Kahlo were often separated from each other, due to the political instability and violence of the period, so they exchanged passionate love letters.[15][170]  1925–1930: Bus accident and marr', 'Arias and Kahlo were often separated from each other, due to the political instability and violence of the period, so they exchanged passionate love letters.[15][170]  1925–1930: Bus accident and marriage to Diego Rivera  Kahlo photographed by her father in 1926  On 17 September 1925, Kahlo and her boyfriend, Arias, were on their way home from school.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
