  ('ev_wiki_frida-kahlo_1941_11', 'ent_frida-kahlo', '1941-04', 1941, 'death', 'narrative',
   'Due to her spinal problems, she wore twenty-eight separate supportive corsets, varying from steel and leather to plaster, between 1940 and 1954.[246] She experienced pain in her legs, the infection on', 'Due to her spinal problems, she wore twenty-eight separate supportive corsets, varying from steel and leather to plaster, between 1940 and 1954.[246] She experienced pain in her legs, the infection on her hand had become chronic, and she was also treated for syphilis.[247] The death of her father in April 1941 plunged her into a depression.[242] Her ill health made her increasingly confined to La Casa Azul, which became the center of her world.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
   'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frida_Kahlo', 0.7, 11, 'en', 'MONTH', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
