  ('ev_wiki_bjarne-stroustrup_1985_7', 'ent_bjarne-stroustrup', NULL, 1985, 'personal_life', 'narrative',
   'In his own words, he "invented C++, wrote its early definitions, and produced its first implementation [...] chose and formulated the design criteria for C++, designed all its major facilities, and wa', 'In his own words, he "invented C++, wrote its early definitions, and produced its first implementation [...] chose and formulated the design criteria for C++, designed all its major facilities, and was responsible for the processing of extension proposals in the C++ standards committee." C++ was made generally available in 1985.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
