  ('ev_wiki_bjarne-stroustrup_1985_8', 'ent_bjarne-stroustrup', NULL, 1985, 'personal_life', 'narrative',
   'Stroustrup also published a textbook for the language in 1985, The C++ Programming Language.[16]  The key language-technical areas of contribution of C++ are:  A static type system with equal support ', 'Stroustrup also published a textbook for the language in 1985, The C++ Programming Language.[16]  The key language-technical areas of contribution of C++ are:  A static type system with equal support for built-in types and user-defined types (that requires control of the construction, destruction, copying, and movement of objects; and operator overloading).', 'src_en_wikipedia',
   'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bjarne_Stroustrup', 0.7, 8, 'en', 'YEAR', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
