  ('ev_wiki_bjarne-stroustrup_1994_9', 'ent_bjarne-stroustrup', NULL, 1994, 'personal_life', 'narrative',
   'Stroustrup documented his principles guiding the design of C++ and the evolution of the language in his 1994 book, The Design and Evolution of C++,[17] and three papers for ACM''s History of Programmin', 'Stroustrup documented his principles guiding the design of C++ and the evolution of the language in his 1994 book, The Design and Evolution of C++,[17] and three papers for ACM''s History of Programming Languages conferences.[18][19][20]  Stroustrup was a founding member of the C++ standards committee (from 1989, it was an ANSI committee and from 1991 an ISO committee) and has remained an active member ever since.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
