  ('ev_wiki_chief-joseph_1877_17', 'ent_chief-joseph', NULL, 1877, 'personal_life', 'narrative',
   'McWhorter, who concluded "that Chief Joseph was not a military man at all, that on the battlefield he was without either skill or experience".[22] Furthermore, Merle Wells argues in The Nez Perce and ', 'McWhorter, who concluded "that Chief Joseph was not a military man at all, that on the battlefield he was without either skill or experience".[22] Furthermore, Merle Wells argues in The Nez Perce and Their War that the interpretation of the Nez Perce War of 1877 in military terms as used in the United States Army''s account distorts the actions of the Nez Perce.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
