   'Since the 18th century, Chinese authorities have asserted the right to oversee the selection of Tibetan spiritual leaders, including the Dalai and Panchen Lamas.[citation needed] This practice was for', 'Since the 18th century, Chinese authorities have asserted the right to oversee the selection of Tibetan spiritual leaders, including the Dalai and Panchen Lamas.[citation needed] This practice was formalized in 1793 through the "29-Article Ordinance for the More Effective Governing of Tibet".[16]  According to Tibetan Buddhist doctrine, the Dalai Lama chooses his reincarnation.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
