   'In 1718 they were halted not far from Lhasa to be defeated and then annihilated by the Dzungars in the Battle of the Salween River.[174][175]  Enthronement in Lhasa  This humiliation only determined t', 'In 1718 they were halted not far from Lhasa to be defeated and then annihilated by the Dzungars in the Battle of the Salween River.[174][175]  Enthronement in Lhasa  This humiliation only determined the Kangxi Emperor to expel the Dzungars from Tibet once and for all and he set about assembling and dispatching a much larger force to march on Lhasa, bringing the emperor''s trump card the young Kelzang Gyatso with it.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
