  ('ev_wiki_davy-crockett_1753_7', 'ent_davy-crockett', NULL, 1753, 'birth', 'narrative',
   'Historical records indicate that David and Elizabeth were the parents of William, David Jr., Robert, Alexander, James, Joseph, and John (the father of Davy Crockett); they may have had additional chil', 'Historical records indicate that David and Elizabeth were the parents of William, David Jr., Robert, Alexander, James, Joseph, and John (the father of Davy Crockett); they may have had additional children whose records have not yet been found.[9][10]  John was born c. 1753 in Frederick County, Virginia.[10] The family moved to Tryon County, North Carolina c. 1768.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
