   'US chart, the first rap song to do so.[217] The album''s title was later revealed to be Scarlet in mid-August 2023.[205] The second promotional single, "Demons", was released in early September 2023, a', 'US chart, the first rap song to do so.[217] The album''s title was later revealed to be Scarlet in mid-August 2023.[205] The second promotional single, "Demons", was released in early September 2023, alongside a music video directed by Christian Breslauer and co-starring American actress Christina Ricci.[218]  Scarlet was released to mostly positive reviews on September 22, 2023,[219][220] and debuted within the top 5 in the United States, the United Kingdom and Canada.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
