   'Early life and education  Dustin Lee Hoffman was born on August 8, 1937, in Los Angeles, California, the younger of two sons of Harry Hoffman (1907–1990)[9] and Lillian (née Gold; 1909–1982).[10] His ', 'Early life and education  Dustin Lee Hoffman was born on August 8, 1937, in Los Angeles, California, the younger of two sons of Harry Hoffman (1907–1990)[9] and Lillian (née Gold; 1909–1982).[10] His father worked as a prop supervisor (set decorator) at Columbia Pictures before becoming a furniture salesman.[11]  Hoffman was named after stage and silent screen actor Dustin Farnum.[12] He has an elder brother Ronald, who is a lawyer and economist.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
